AI generated video refers to synthetic moving image content created through generative artificial intelligence models such as diffusion networks and generative adversarial networks (GANs). These systems translate textual prompts, audio cues, or static images into fully rendered video sequences, enabling use cases ranging from avatar based presentations and product visualisations to photorealistic scene synthesis for entertainment.
